  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Bistecca alla fiorentina is about three things: good beef, a screaming hot pan, and time. You "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "sear",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "sear"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " thick steaks on a dry griddle until a deep crust forms, then leave them to rest without covering. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Resting",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "resting"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " for a full 10 minutes is not optional."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Take the steaks out of the fridge a full hour before cooking. Cold meat straight onto a hot pan gives you a grey, steamed outside instead of a crust."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
